    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.<br><br>Welcome to Beachview Cottage & Carriage House, a stunning retreat just off the Gulf, offering breathtaking Gulf views from all floors. This exquisite property seamlessly blends indoor and outdoor living with its charming porches, courtyard spaces, and a thoughtfully designed floor plan perfect for family gatherings.<br>First Floor: Enter through the soaring foyer that leads to four guest bedrooms:<br>•\tGuest bedroom with a king bed and private bathroom with two separate single vanities, and a walk-in shower<br>•\t2nd guest bedroom with a king bed and private bathroom with a single vanity and walk-in shower<br>•\tGuest bedroom with two twin beds – would use the shared bathroom with the bunk room featuring a double vanity and large walk-in shower<br>•\tBunk room featuring a twin over full – would use the shared bathroom with the twin room featuring a double vanity and large walk-in shower<br>Second Floor: The main living space opens up on the second floor, complete with a balcony overlooking the courtyard and pool area, providing marvelous views of the Gulf. The master bedroom on this floor boasts a king bed, a private balcony, and an en suite bathroom with a double vanity, large soaking tub, and walk-in shower. Additionally, there's a convenient half bath and a staircase leading to the third-floor crows nest, which offers panoramic Gulf views.<br>Outdoor Living: Step outside to find a pergola overlooking the stunning private pool, a porch extending the length of the home wrapping around along the boardwalk, an outdoor grill, and plenty of entertainment space for the entire family to gather.<br>Carriage House: The carriage house features:<br>•\tA private king bedroom and a loft with a full-size bed.<br>•\tA first-floor living space and a shared bathroom.<br>•\tA wrap-around balcony with views of the courtyard and glimpses of the Gulf.<br>Beachview Cottage and Carriage House is the ideal destination for those seeking a perfect balance of family gathering space and stunning views of the beautiful Gulf of Mexico.<br><br>Garage parking for 2 vehicles. <br><br>**THIS PROPERTY REQUIRES A 7 NIGHT RENTAL SATURDAY - SATURDAY YEAR ROUND**<br>Pool can be heated October 1st through May 1st for an additional fee.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
