        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "I liked being the second from the beach. House was perfect in size and accessories for the family. I was impressed with the alarm due to the pool. But was irritating, too. Great location to the little town of Rosemary and good restaurants. I felt like the office cd have had a Hospitality basket with goodies and list of places to eat and shop. Not everyone has been in Rosemary. Just an idea.",
