        "id": "60eb755a8282d648bb099098",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "text": "Rosemary Beach is not the community it used to be. Developers have bought into the HOA and it shows. Services are lacking, properties are worn and the insane price we paid was not meet with the level of service, cleanliness or concern expected. Our family time was amazing but we will not return to Rosemary Beach. Overly commercialized haven for twenty somethings, not the jewel it was a decade ago. Sad.",
